OL,3,GHighlands & Eilean Siar
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FBright with sunny spells and
OL,6,Fscattered showers, the best of the dry
OL,7,Fweather towards Inverness and Nairn.
OL,8,FBreezy to start but winds becoming
OL,9,Flight through the day.
OL,10,
OL,11,CTonight:FMostly dry with some bright
OL,12,Fspells at first. Patchy rain spreading
OL,13,Fnorth through the evening, becoming
OL,14,Fheavier at times overnight but staying
OL,15,Fmostly dry in the east. Strengthening
OL,16,Fsoutherly winds.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
