OL,3,GHighlands & Eilean Siar
OL,4,
OL,5,CSunday:FCloudy and windy with some
OL,6,Fshowery outbreaks of rain spreading
OL,7,Feast, the rain heavy at times. Gales
OL,8,Fdeveloping during the day, easing
OL,9,Fsomewhat in the evening.
OL,10,
OL,11,COutlook for Monday to Wednesday:FBright
OL,12,Fstart Monday, then becoming windy with
OL,13,Fgales and occasionally heavy rain or
OL,14,Fshowers, this persisting through
OL,15,FTuesday. Rain and strong winds
OL,16,Fclearing early Wednesday, dry with
OL,17,Fbright spells later.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
